Tether the target to the location for [6, 6, 7, 7, 8 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.

Each turn the target has a 15% chance per tile it's travelled away from the tether to be teleported back, inflicting [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical and [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal (warp) damage to all enemies in a radius of [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] at both the entrance and exit locations.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
